{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0001837240","cik":"0001837240","slug":"symbotic-837240","name":"Symbotic Inc.","ticker":"SYM","exchanges":["Nasdaq"],"sector":"General Industrial Machinery & Equipment, NEC","sic":"3569","country":"MA","website":"","listed_years":4.4,"first_annual":"2022-03-23","last_filing":"2026-07-29","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001837240&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["Symbotic Inc. files with the SEC under \"General Industrial Machinery & Equipment, NEC\", based in MA, and has been publicly reporting for 4 years.","It reported $2.4bn of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 23.1% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 22.2%.","Listed on Nasdaq, it funds itself from operations ($467.5m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 23.1% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $676.5m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1837240/000183724026000024/0001837240-26-000024-index.htm","accession":"0001837240-26-000024"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1837240/000183724026000024/0001837240-26-000024-index.htm","accession":"0001837240-26-000024"},{"text":"Gross margin expanded from 20.2% to 22.2% against the same quarter a year earlier - the company is keeping more of what it sells, not buying growth with discounts.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1837240/000183724026000024/0001837240-26-000024-index.htm","accession":"0001837240-26-000024"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $467.5m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1837240/000183724026000009/0001837240-26-000009-index.htm","accession":"0001837240-26-000009"},{"text":"Net cash of $2.0bn against total assets of $3.5bn - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1837240/000183724026000024/0001837240-26-000024-index.htm","accession":"0001837240-26-000024"}],"bear":[{"text":"Gross margin is only 22.2%, so scale has to be enormous before anything reaches the bottom line.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1837240/000183724026000024/0001837240-26-000024-index.htm","accession":"0001837240-26-000024"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 24.7% over the year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1837240/000183724026000024/0001837240-26-000024-index.htm","accession":"0001837240-26-000024"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 16.5% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (86,548 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1837240/000193297326000021/0001932973-26-000021-index.htm"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.3% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1837240/000193297326000021/0001932973-26-000021-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 14.0% for 